247
00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:58.640
Siis on üks jah, praegu kuulan ka.

248
00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:00.720
Igasugust.

249
00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:03.300
Kuigi öeldakse,
